{
  "id": "developmental-coordination-disorder",
  "term": "developmental coordination disorder",
  "definition": "Developmental coordination disorder is a neurodevelopmental disorder in which motor coordination is much weaker than expected for a person’s age and intellectual level. The motor problems are persistent and substantially interfere with everyday activities and school performance, and they may also be accompanied by cognitive and psychosocial difficulties.",
